            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^«Ходімо!» (Let's go!) ",
                "#",
                "^speaker:npc_ivanka",
                "/#",
                "\n",
                "end",
                {
                  "->": "0.12"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^Ivanka is kicking a ball under the tree. She hasn't noticed you. ",
          "#",
          "^speaker:narrator",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "^You walk up to her. How do you call her? ",
          "#",
          "^quiz:picnic_call_1",
          "/#",
          "\n",
          "ev",
          {
            "VAR?": "quiz_ok"
          },
          "/ev",
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b",
              "c": true
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^«Іванко, ходи сюди!» She turns around.",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.29"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          [
            {
              "->": ".^.b"
            },
            {
              "b": [
                "\n",
                "^It's «Іванко, ходи сюди», with «Іванко», not «Іванка». She turns around anyway.",
                "\n",
                {
                  "->": "0.29"
                },
                null
              ]
            }
          ],
          "nop",
          "\n",
          "^«Що?» (What?) ",
